        <title>new comment 5591757 (near Belváros, Szeged) / 
      Created &lt;time title=&quot;20 October 2026 at 17:31&quot; datetime=&quot;2026-10-20T17:31:46Z&quot;&gt;13 days ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/CopperOppositeKindred&quot;&gt;CopperOppositeKindred&lt;/a&gt;
